  "summary": "Static tests cover partial and full refunds, exact exhaustion through repeated partial refunds, rejection of amounts above remaining, rejection of Multi refunds, clamping to remaining, cash/noncash operational-shift policy for closed originals, same-open-shift cash refunds, and cancellation prohibition after a refund. These align with Order.ApplyRefund and RefundRules. The test MakeOrder default is paid Cash; no test exercises pending/uncollected single-method orders. That gap matches existing FIN-003 (refund handler trusts total less prior refunds without proving collection). The closed-original cash rule is tested, but reconciliation impact is not; the integration gap is separately covered by FIN-004. No additional defect or duplicate promoted.",
